        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "西貢一間充滿懷舊風味嘅舊式麵包舖。純蛋白芝士麵包每日新鮮出爐，限量供應，香軟可口，值得一試！\n\n坐嚮舖頭外面，兩張細枱仔！\n\nA traditional old-style bakery in Sai Kung. Their egg white cheese bread is freshly baked daily and available in limited quantities—soft, fresh, and definitely worth trying!\n\nThere are also two small tables outside the shop, perfect for sitting down and enjoying your bread in a relaxed, old-Hong Kong atmosphere.",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "西貢一間充滿懷舊風味嘅舊式麵包舖。純蛋白芝士麵包每日新鮮出爐，限量供應，香軟可口，值得一試！\n\n坐嚮舖頭外面，兩張細枱仔！\n\nA traditional old-style bakery in Sai Kung. Their egg white cheese bread is freshly baked daily and available in limited quantities—soft, fresh, and definitely worth trying!\n\nThere are also two small tables outside the shop, perfect for sitting down and enjoying your bread in a relaxed, old-Hong Kong atmosphere.",
